            F0 M5.5 2H14.5C15.3284 2 16 2.67157 16 3.5V16.5C16 17.3284 15.3284 18 14.5 18H5.5C4.67157 18 4 17.3284 4 16.5V3.5C4 2.67157 4.67157 2 5.5 2Z M6.5 6H13.5V7.2H6.5Z M6.5 9.4 H13.5V10.6H6.5Z M6.5 12.8H11V14H6.5Z
        </StreamGeometry>

        <StreamGeometry x:Key="IconoArchivoComprimido">
            F0 M5.5 2H14.5C15.3284 2 16 2.67157 16 3.5V16.5C16 17.3284 15.3284 18 14.5 18H5.5C4.67157 18 4 17.3284 4 16.5V3.5C4 2.67157 4.67157 2 5.5 2Z M9.4 3.4H10.6V5H9.4Z M9.4 6.2 H10.6V7.8H9.4Z M9.4 9H10.6V10.6H9.4Z M8.9 12.2H11.1V15.6H8.9Z
        </StreamGeometry>

